14:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm text-zinc-400","children":["The blocks are hours of planned running, not output — a tall block on a slow line makes fewer litres than a short one on a fast line. Height is drawn against the full ",12,"-hour shift, and the plan already runs every line at an efficiency of ",50,"%: ","every stored rate is multiplied by this efficiency in the plan; for the two slots stored at OBSERVED rates (Clear Pack 5L, Tin Head) that is a second derate on top of observation — the honest phrasing is 'observed rate, then 50% efficiency'","."]}]
